# Glowify Skincare Website 

Glowify is a modern skincare brand website built using HTML, CSS, and Bootstrap. It is designed to showcase beauty products, provide company information, and allow users to get in touch easily.

---

##  Project Features

- Responsive homepage design
- About Us page with brand story
- Product listing page (grid layout)
- Contact page with form and contact info overlay
- Google Maps integration (location display)
- Instagram-style image hover gallery
- Newsletter subscription section
- Mobile-friendly design

---

##  Built With

- HTML5
- CSS3
- Bootstrap 5
- Bootstrap Icons

